{"id":"n28086-2-7","stage":4,"title":"고기잡이 · 渔夫","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28086-2-7-1","ko":"너희 아버지 직업이 무엇이니?","zh":"你们父亲的职业是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"직업이","meaning":"职业","explanation":"직업：职业；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직업","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83178","senseId":"1","lemma":"직업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직업이","audio":"/audio/4f525e0dc1bce84249cd.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇이니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇이니","audio":"/audio/55dd9f2a443405c96e22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代包括听者在内的多数人，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"c9b556a731fbce64","term":"직업","zh":"职业","audio":"/audio/c9b556a731fbce64bcd4.mp3","entryId":"83178","definition":"领报酬而从事的工作。","pronunciation":["지겁"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1a9e6e28831d4890c86.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28086-2-7-2","ko":"고기잡이셔서 바다에 배 타러 나가셨어요.","zh":"他是渔夫，所以去海上乘船捕鱼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고기잡이셔서","meaning":"渔夫","explanation":"고기잡이：渔夫；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"고기잡이","audio":"/audio/5ffea51a43f7d26a12db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28086","senseId":"2","lemma":"고기잡이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고기잡이셔서","audio":"/audio/d947dea11e2b50d000f9.mp3"}},{"text":"바다에","meaning":"海，大海，海洋","explanation":"바다：海，大海，海洋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바다","audio":"/audio/1ea5c356f65344cfeb55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26497","senseId":"1","lemma":"바다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바다에","audio":"/audio/f90059be936edf357e9a.mp3"}},{"text":"배","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}},{"text":"타러","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타러","audio":"/audio/dc1f88b05849fdbc6221.mp3"}},{"text":"나가셨어요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가셨어요","audio":"/audio/50d57af3000c4e805f32.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5ff